<p data-pm-slice="1 1 &#091;&#093;"><strong>We’ve moved to our new lesson portal: <a href="http://learn.robolink.com">Robolink Learn</a>! Lessons here will remain available until the end of June 2026. This version of Basecamp will no longer be updated and uses outdated references to Blockly for Robolink. You can access the previous version of <a href="https://codrone.robolink.com/edu/blockly-archive/">Blockly here</a>.</strong></p>

